  "improvements": [
    "Seven source parts previously removed by a generic scenery mask are preserved; source geometry now has explicit membership and cache validation.",
    "The monorail, sculpted shell and valid viewpoints remain in the scene."
  ],
  "remainingGaps": [
    "Actual arrival and postcard views show large rectangular source parts obscuring the existing sculpted shell. The museum needs a unified source-part model that represents every real volume; deleting those parts is not an acceptable fix.",
    "The native plaque walk is blocked and ends beside a building and visitor.",
    "The shared scene's first activity approach is the Space Needle entrance, not the MoPOP monorail viewpoint.",
    "The existing monorail handler can award on a single click while the train happens to pass; it needs real participation and cancellation coverage.",
    "Raw audit findings remain for physical review: zfight 53, phantom 1, pedBelow 3.",
    "41.1 m walked toward Paul Allen; Native walker blocked on planned public path."
  ],
